{"skill":{"slug":"creative-writing-cellcog","displayName":"Creative Writing"},"version":{"version":"1.0.15","createdAt":1787536993042,"changelog":"Content updated.","changelogSource":"user","license":"MIT-0","files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":8717,"sha256":"574e2c06e97a4f4b7f7153f6a5fdd86fc6197d63a47ed4ef4b26c4952f1777de","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":1903,"sha256":"98a97d03a742168749cd259787fc2a1461177313053091d79ea9f82971d336f0","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"clean","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1789037281117,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"8be5f5071893619ef619eb823d7b51bc5a5c06f0485b0f3b181e04691d70e74f","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/8be5f5071893619ef619eb823d7b51bc5a5c06f0485b0f3b181e04691d70e74f","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":null,"normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":null,"source":"engines","checkedAt":1787537722290},"skillspector":{"status":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","score":18,"severity":"LOW","recommendation":"CAUTION","issueCount":2,"checkedAt":1789037281117},"llm":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","confidence":"medium","summary":"This is a coherent creative-writing skill that uses CellCog as expected, but users should be aware that prompts go to an external service and the install examples are not version-pinned.","dimensions":[{"detail":"Requiring python3 and CELLCOG_API_KEY is proportionate for a CellCog-backed service integration, but users should understand that submitted prompts may leave the local environment.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The setup guidance uses mutable install commands such as npx, openclaw install, and pip install -U without pinning versions or checksums, which is a supply-chain caution but not evidence of malicious behavior in this artifact.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The instructions focus on user-supplied creative-writing prompts and do not include prompt hijacking, unsafe role changes, destructive actions, or unrelated data access.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The inspected artifact contains no background services, scheduled tasks, memory-writing instructions, privilege escalation, or persistence mechanisms.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The artifact is a Markdown-only skill for creative writing workflows using CellCog chat calls; the API key requirement and CellCog dependency fit the stated purpose.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"ok"}],"guidance":"Install only if you are comfortable using CellCog as an external service for your writing prompts and drafts. Avoid submitting confidential manuscripts, secrets, regulated data, or proprietary world-building unless you have approved that transfer, and prefer pinned or verified package versions when installing dependencies.","findings":"[SQP-2] expected: The external CellCog use is consistent with the skill purpose and is implied by the dependency, homepage, API key, and client.create_chat examples, but the artifact could be clearer that prompts and drafts are sent to CellCog.\n[RP1] expected: The unpinned install examples are a real supply-chain caution for users, but the artifact itself is Markdown-only and contains no bundled executable payload or deceptive install behavior.\n[T08] expected: The static dependency finding is supported by the unpinned cellcog dependency and mutable setup commands; this warrants user caution rather than a malicious or Review verdict by itself.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1789037281117}}}}}